date: 2026-02-03T00:00:00-04:00
---

The Masque District is a part of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]] where visitors to the city keep their hotels. It is the entertainment district of the capital: casinos, high-end bars, the finest hotels, plays and museums, and further in a red light district with a brothel and a cabaret. Money moves freely through it and is lost just as freely into the hands of the few who control most of the district.

The [[Org/Velvet Mark/index|Velvet Mark]] is one of those powers. Its penthouse offices look out over the district from the twenty-seventh floor of a smaller tower, high enough to see the streets below but low enough to be hard to spot from them. The district borders [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Teller's Run/index|Teller's Run]], and lately [[Org/Pyrelight/index|Pyrelight]]'s growth out of that poor neighborhood has become a concern to the people who profit here.

On the district's edge stands the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Masque District/Belvedere Library|Belvedere library]], a building the size of a city block that Belvedere keeps as a statement of its reach in the city.
